id: pm-todos-native-kv-codec
title: Investigate native history round-trips for prototype-named extension metadata
description: "A real non-git tracker using the public mutateItem callback with extensionFieldNames and an own __proto__ entry in todos_kv failed verifyHistoryEntries against the SDK-read document immediately after persistence. Existing todo.txt parsing drops this key, while a safe own-key parser exposed the native codec mismatch. Cross-file source inputs now refuse new __proto__ tokens before mutation; historical source strings still read and export. Reproduce and resolve through the public SDK before lifting that guard; never repair or rewrite existing history. No upstream GitHub issue was filed under the execution rules."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags[2]: native-history,sdk-compatibility
